  `skyscraperSheaf`,
  `sheafSections`;
- best owner abstraction: the canonical sheaf-level owners above, specialized to the explicit
  two-closed-points space and the open immersions `j_n : U_n ⟶ X`;
- primitive data:
  the space `TwoClosedPointsPoint`,
  the opens `U_n`,
  the inclusions `j_n`,
  the value object `AddCommGrpCat.of ℤ`,
  the filtered system `n ↦ j_{n,*}\underline{Z}`,
  and the filtered system `n ↦ ∏_{m ≥ n} Z`;
- derived API:
